00:13:08.154 --> 00:13:08.654
All right.

00:13:08.654 --> 00:13:12.124
Now what do I do?

00:13:12.124 --> 00:13:13.159
And that's it?

00:13:13.159 --> 00:13:14.560
This is pre-mixed?

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.194
Oh.

00:13:15.194 --> 00:13:15.694
OK.

00:13:15.694 --> 00:13:19.698
Now, this is an example
of how we can change--

00:13:19.698 --> 00:13:25.971
we can control the color of
a material using chemistry.

00:13:25.971 --> 00:13:27.640
We can control when--

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:28.340
do I pour it all?

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:29.375
Do I pour it all?

00:13:29.375 --> 00:13:29.875
OK.

00:13:29.875 --> 00:13:30.376
Why not?

00:13:30.376 --> 00:13:32.545
Yeah.

00:13:32.545 --> 00:13:33.045
OK.

00:13:33.045 --> 00:13:35.881
Now I want you to focus
on the larger bottle.

00:13:35.881 --> 00:13:38.651
Nothing is happening.

00:13:38.651 --> 00:13:39.819
Keep watching it.

00:13:39.819 --> 00:13:41.120
You've got to keep watching it.

00:13:45.024 --> 00:13:45.825
See?

00:13:45.825 --> 00:13:47.226
That's an example.

00:13:47.226 --> 00:13:50.729
But your students, your kids are
seeing this and they're saying,

00:13:50.729 --> 00:13:53.265
no, it's all about
electron levels.

00:13:53.265 --> 00:13:56.335
I've got to go and write
down those electron levels.

00:13:56.335 --> 00:13:59.138
I don't care if it's a Bohr
model or a semiconductor

00:13:59.138 --> 00:13:59.705
bandgap.

00:13:59.705 --> 00:14:01.740
I've got to figure
out how that happened.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:03.108
How did the color change?

00:14:03.108 --> 00:14:05.644
I changed the electron
levels in the liquid.

00:14:05.644 --> 00:14:06.378
That's what I did.

00:14:06.378 --> 00:14:07.613
And I controlled the kinetics.

00:14:07.613 --> 00:14:13.686
So my suggested topics for
this one of discussion--

00:14:13.686 --> 00:14:15.187
chemical kinetics.

00:14:15.187 --> 00:14:17.189
Now, we're going to talk
about chemical kinetics

00:14:17.189 --> 00:14:18.657
later in the fall,
but you guys can

00:14:18.657 --> 00:14:21.026
get a head start this weekend.

00:14:21.026 --> 00:14:22.494
Because that's what
happened there.

00:14:22.494 --> 00:14:25.264
We controlled when it-- it
didn't happen right away.

00:14:25.264 --> 00:14:26.465
It happened later.

00:14:26.465 --> 00:14:28.133
Why?

00:14:28.133 --> 00:14:31.003
Acids and bases, also coming
later, get a head start.

00:14:31.003 --> 00:14:32.538
And then how to
paint with electrons,

00:14:32.538 --> 00:14:35.574
because that is
what we're doing.

00:14:35.574 --> 00:14:38.444
We're changing how electrons
interact with the material

00:14:38.444 --> 00:14:39.545
to change the color.

00:14:39.545 --> 00:14:40.746
We are painting.

00:14:40.746 --> 00:14:44.183
And that's what nature
is doing with its leaves.

00:14:44.183 --> 00:14:48.254
Now, you might be on
this walk, and you

00:14:48.254 --> 00:14:50.289
might be strolling
around, and you might not

00:14:50.289 --> 00:14:51.790
go into the countryside.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:54.860
You might just be
down Mass Ave. Now,

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:56.729
if you're walking down
Mass Ave from here,

00:14:56.729 --> 00:14:58.864
and you go not towards
Boston but the other way,

00:14:58.864 --> 00:15:00.032
you get to another school.

00:15:02.635 --> 00:15:03.369
Now, I've got to--

00:15:06.272 --> 00:15:08.607
I have talked to your
kids about this already.

00:15:08.607 --> 00:15:10.743
What I want to do right
now is address the parents.

00:15:14.947 --> 00:15:17.917
You have activities
you're going to, right?

00:15:17.917 --> 00:15:19.685
And some of them may involve--

00:15:19.685 --> 00:15:21.387
I don't know, a
dinner or a party,

00:15:21.387 --> 00:15:23.789
or a lot of other parents.

00:15:23.789 --> 00:15:27.693
Some of those
parents may have kids

00:15:27.693 --> 00:15:30.596
that go to the other school.

00:15:30.596 --> 00:15:34.433
Now, here's what I
want to tell you.

00:15:34.433 --> 00:15:44.443
It might not be their fault.
It might not be their fault.

00:15:44.443 --> 00:15:47.046
I'm just saying we do the
best we can as parents.

00:15:47.046 --> 00:15:49.014
We do.

00:15:49.014 --> 00:15:50.449
We do everything we can.

00:15:50.449 --> 00:15:52.184
We did everything right.

00:15:52.184 --> 00:15:55.354
And then you realize
