00:27:19.237 --> 00:27:22.374
All that you need is to
pull the liquid nitrogen out

00:27:22.374 --> 00:27:25.777
of your dorm closet, and--

00:27:25.777 --> 00:27:27.312
yeah, OK.

00:27:29.981 --> 00:27:30.915
You want to go ahead?

00:27:30.915 --> 00:27:31.416
Yeah.

00:27:33.918 --> 00:27:38.089
And fill it with
water because you

00:27:38.089 --> 00:27:40.625
