00:34:01.439 --> 00:34:03.241
You can't do that.

00:34:03.241 --> 00:34:04.275
It's not going to happen.

00:34:04.275 --> 00:34:07.412
It won't be as much of a bond.

00:34:07.412 --> 00:34:08.478
