putting certain chemistry

00:39:38.342 --> 00:39:40.978
inside the glass,
ions, that are bigger,

00:39:40.978 --> 00:39:43.047
that causes a strain
in the material, that

00:39:43.047 --> 00:39:45.082
tighten the surface.

00:39:45.082 --> 00:39:47.451
And so there's all
this stress built up,

00:39:47.451 --> 00:39:49.820
and it's all at the very edge.

00:39:49.820 --> 00:39:52.390
So this part is
super, super strong.

00:39:52.390 --> 00:39:56.594
But this part, just
a simple little tap--

00:39:56.594 --> 00:39:59.530
