you think, I guess, in this one.

00:40:12.877 --> 00:40:17.348
And also, don't tap
the edges of glass,

00:40:17.348 --> 00:40:18.983
especially if it's tempered.

00:40:18.983 --> 00:40:22.319
Because that's what makes it so
tough on this on the surface.

00:40:22.319 --> 00:40:23.754
But the strain builds up.

00:40:23.754 --> 00:40:28.426
And if you relieve it with
just a tiny, little tap, boom.

00:40:28.426 --> 00:40:33.197
